  "cards": [
    { "dot": "cyan", "title": "主循环（主要数据路径）", "items": [
      "每帧：handleEvents → update(delta) → render → dispatcher::update",
      "input → GameApp → SceneManager → Scene → ECS 系统 → registry → Renderer → present",
      "SceneManager：只 update 栈顶、render 整个栈（push = 覆盖层）",
      "Scene::init() 返回 bool，失败即 QuitEvent 快速退出"
    ] },
    { "dot": "emerald", "title": "ECS 数据流", "items": [
      "每个 Scene 持有独立 entt::registry；实体 = 组件组合",
      "registry.ctx() 定位器：SessionData / BlueprintManager / UIConfig / LevelConfig 等",
      "Context：DI 容器，持有全部引擎模块引用",
      "蓝图 JSON 建实体；LevelLoader 把 Tiled → ECS；AudioSystem 响应 PlaySoundEvent"
    ] },
    { "dot": "amber", "title": "外部依赖与可靠性", "items": [
      "SDL3 + image/mixer/ttf（vendored）；EnTT registry + dispatcher 事件总线",
      "ImGui：仅 isPlaying()/isPaused() 渲染（安全组边界）；spdlog / glm / json",
      "SDL3.4 适配：缓存/恢复逻辑分辨率（0x0）；纹理加载先判空；/MP + Ninja 并行编译"
    ] }
  ]
